## Provenance

Every icon in `icons/` is generated by `tools/gen_icons.py`, which draws them
from geometric primitives — circles, squares, triangles and rounded
rectangles — using Pillow. There is no traced artwork, no font glyph, no stock
image and no third-party asset anywhere in the set. Regenerate them at any time
with:

    python tools/gen_icons.py

`foiledfile.png` is the original reference mark this style was matched to. It
is not read by the generator and is not compiled into the binary.

